 items regularly and notify subscribers first.<\/p>"}},"item_QQk3Qt":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"How should I clean beds, collars, and fabric items?","answer":"<p>Most fabric items are machine-washable on gentle cycle; check the care label on each product. Wipe harnesses and plastic parts with mild soap and water; avoid harsh chemicals.<\/p>"}},"item_4GfhAc":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"What if my pet doesn’t like a product?","answer":"<p>Contact us within 30 days. We’ll help with a return or exchange so you can find a better fit.<\/p>"}},"item_A9LCz7":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"Do you offer subscriptions or auto-delivery?","answer":"<p>Not yet. We’re exploring subscription options for food and essentials—join the newsletter to be notified when it launches.<\/p>"}},"q1":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"What is your return policy?","answer":"<p>We offer free returns within 30 days of delivery. Items must be unused and in original packaging. Start a return from your order confirmation email or contact care@petlio.com.<\/p>"}},"q2":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"How long does shipping take?","answer":"<p>Orders ship within 1–2 business days. Standard delivery takes 3–7 business days in the US. You will receive tracking as soon as your order leaves our warehouse.<\/p>"}},"q3":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"Do you ship internationally?","answer":"<p>Yes. We ship to most countries. International delivery typically takes 7–14 business days. Duties and taxes may apply depending on your region.<\/p>"}},"q4":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"How do I choose the right size for collars, harnesses, or beds?","answer":"<p>Each product page includes a size guide with measurements. When in doubt, size up for comfort—especially for growing pets—or message us with your pet’s weight and breed and we’ll help.<\/p>"}},"q5":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"Are your products safe for pets?","answer":"<p>Yes. We source materials intended for pet use and list materials and care notes on every product. If you ever have a concern, contact us and we’ll make it right.<\/p>"}},"q6":{"type":"item","settings":{"question":"Can I change or cancel my order?","answer":"<p>If your order has not shipped yet, email care@petlio.com with your order number and we’ll do our best to update or cancel it. Once shipped, you can use our 30-day return window.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_MGVwGR","item_QQk3Qt","item_4GfhAc","item_A9LCz7","q1","q2","q3","q4","q5","q6"],"settings":{"heading":"Frequently asked questions","subheading":"Help center","description":"<p>Quick answers about shipping, returns, sizing, and care. Still stuck? We’re here.<\/p>","layout":"wide","icon_style":"heart","open_first":true,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#1a1a1a","accent_color":"#121212"}},"testimonials_ed3KDA":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonial_BBbJyH":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"headline":"Best treats ever!","quote":"My dog goes absolutely wild for these — and they're actually good for him too.","rating":5,"author":"Sarah J.","verified":true}},"testimonial_RRwKKA":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"headline":"Fast shipping, happy cat","quote":"Ordered Monday, arrived Wednesday. My cat approves, which is rare.","rating":5,"author":"Michael C.","verified":true}},"testimonial_k3VKq9":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"headline":"Exactly as described","quote":"The quality is premium and it's clear a lot of care went into these products.","rating":4,"author":"Emily D.","verified":true}}},"block_order":["testimonial_BBbJyH","testimonial_RRwKKA","testimonial_k3VKq9"],"name":"t:sections.testimonials.presets.name","settings":{"enable_parallax":true,"kicker_text":"REAL STORIES","heading":"Happy pets. Happier people.","subheading":"Don't take our word for it","show_rating":true,"show_view_all":false,"view_all_text":"View All Testimonials","view_all_link":"","background_color":"#f7f3eb","text_color":"#273028","c